--[[
    TRIAL CHAMBER - STRUCTURE BUILDER
    ----------------------------------
    Builds ONLY the physical architecture of the Trial Chamber: floors, walls,
    domed ceilings, portals, and placeholder centerpieces (golem, crystal heart,
    statues). It does NOT build any gameplay logic (no spike traps firing, no
    golem AI, no spell casting, no combat). Those come later as separate
    scripts once the room shapes are locked in.

    LAYOUT (all rooms sit on a straight line along +Z, matching the map's
    linear A -> B -> C progression):

        Entrance Portal  ->  Room A: Shadows (corridor)
                          ->  Connector rubble
                          ->  Room B: Blades (circular arena)
                          ->  Connector rubble
                          ->  Room C: Orrery (domed room)
                          ->  Exit Portal

    HOW TO USE
      1. Paste this whole script into a Script inside ServerScriptService
         (or run it once from the Studio Command Bar).
      2. Play/Run once. Everything appears under Workspace.TrialChamber as
         real, editable, anchored Parts.
      3. This is a ONE-TIME architecture pass, not something meant to
         regenerate on every server start -- once you're happy with the
         shapes, delete/disable this script (or keep it as a "rebuild"
         tool you re-run from the Command Bar while you iterate).

    Every dimension lives in CONFIG below so you can reshape the whole
    building without touching the builder functions.
]]

